### Hae kaikki pelit 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/peli

### Hae peli ID:llä 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/peli/1

### Hae peli ID:llä, jota ei ole 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/peli/99

### Lisää uusi peli 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/peli
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "paikkaId": 1
}

### Muokkaa peliä 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/peli/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "paikkaId": 2
}

### Muokkaa peliä, jota ei ole 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/peli/99
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "peliId": 2
}

### Poista peli 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/peli/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### Poista peli, jolla on tulosta 500
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/peli/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
